{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_01GXmbNyTzGqcv6FABoN1pxc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<promise>COMPLETE</promise>\n\n## Summary\n\nI've successfully implemented US-006: Create event creation modal with vim editing. Here's what was delivered:\n\n### Key Features Implemented\n\n**Modal Functionality:**\n- Opens with 'o' key press (vim-style for insert/open)\n- Centered modal overlay with clear UI\n\n**Form Fields:**\n- Title input field\n- Date picker (YYYY-MM-DD format)\n- Time picker (HH:MM format)\n- Duration input (in minutes)\n- Category selection\n- Description textarea\n\n**Vim-Style Editing:**\n- **Normal Mode**: Navigate and edit with vim commands\n  - `i` - insert mode at cursor\n  - `a` - insert mode after cursor\n  - `A` - insert mode at end\n  - `I` - insert mode at beginning\n  - `h/l` - move cursor left/right\n  - `0/$` - jump to start/end\n  - `x` - delete character\n  - `d` - delete all content\n  - `:` - enter command mode\n  - `j/k` or Tab/arrows - navigate between fields\n  \n- **Insert Mode**: Type text naturally with cursor visualization\n  - Character insertion\n  - Backspace/Delete support\n  - Arrow key navigation\n  - Esc to return to normal mode\n\n- **Command Mode**: Vim-style commands\n  - `:w` - save event\n  - `:q` or `:q!` - cancel/close modal\n  - Esc to return to normal mode\n\n**Keyboard Shortcuts:**\n- `o` - Open modal (from calendar view)\n- `Ctrl+S` - Save event\n- `Esc` - Cancel modal (from normal mode)\n- `:w` - Save via vim command\n- `:q` - Close via vim command\n\n**User Experience:**\n- Form validation with error messages\n- Visual cursor in insert mode (pipe character)\n- Field focus highlighting (yellow border)\n- Mode indicator in title bar (NORMAL/INSERT/COMMAND)\n- Help text at bottom showing available commands\n- Integration with CalendarState for event storage\n\n**Quality Assurance:**\n- ✅ All 52 tests passing\n- ✅ Clippy warnings only for unused code (expected)\n- ✅ Comprehensive test coverage for modal logic\n- ✅ Committed with proper message format\n\nThe modal is fully functional and provides a rich vim-style editing experience for creating calendar events!"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":353,"cache_read_input_tokens":68475,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":353,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":575,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e94c5dd4-d8c3-4732-aab8-59f91986d46d","uuid":"64739bc2-a633-40e9-ab54-c80f30828e64"}
